language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Media selection: choose which advertising media to buy so that every target audience is reached by at least one selected medium, at the lowest total campaign cost.
given incidence_matrix_dim1, incidence_matrix_dim2 : int
letting n_audiences = incidence_matrix_dim1
letting n_media = incidence_matrix_dim2
$ incidence_matrix[a, m] is 1 when medium m reaches audience a
given incidence_matrix : matrix indexed by [int(1..n_audiences), int(1..n_media)] of int
given media_costs : matrix indexed by [int(1..n_media)] of int
find is_selected : matrix indexed by [int(1..n_media)] of bool
find min_total_cost : int(0..sum(media_costs))

branching on [is_selected]
minimising min_total_cost
such that
$ every target audience must be covered by at least one selected medium, so covering it more than once is allowed
forAll a : int(1..n_audiences) . (sum m : int(1..n_media) . incidence_matrix[a, m] * is_selected[m]) >= 1,
$ the total cost of the selected media is the campaign cost
min_total_cost = (sum m : int(1..n_media) . media_costs[m] * is_selected[m])
